 "source_instruction": "na",
 "query": "Ugh, you won\u2019t believe the absolute chaos that went down at my apartment building\u2019s community potluck last night! I showed up with my go-to loaded tater tot casserole, the one I top with extra crispy fried onions and a drizzle of spicy ranch that people usually beg me for the recipe for, only to find out someone had accidentally knocked over the entire dessert table ten minutes before I got there. Half the chocolate sheet cake ended up smooshed into the entryway rug, the lemon bars slid right into a potted fern by the door, and the neighbor who brought the matcha cookies was running around apologizing like it was her fault even though it was totally the guy who tripped over his own golden retriever\u2019s leash. I ended up leaving half my casserole with the group of teens who were hanging out by the grill because they said they\u2019d skipped dinner to get to the potluck early, and I walked home with a random container of pickled okra someone pressed into my hands on my way out, which I don\u2019t even like but felt too rude to turn down.\nHey, I\u2019m browsing the hair extensions, wigs & accessories section right now and I need to grab a wig made of mohair blend for an upcoming costume party. Can you show me options in that one color I always pick for fun event looks? I don\u2019t wanna spend too much, so just keep it under what I usually budget for quick costume pieces, yeah? Let me know what you\u2019ve got that fits!",
